BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jack-O-Lantern Spectacular
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTSTAMP:20260903T144336Z
UID:a11cb847b167f6db3762e7d7aba4@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Jack-O-Lantern Spectacular: The Great Pun-Kin Trail\, presente
 d by Citizens\, returns October 1 &#8211\; November 1 with an all-new trai
 l of clever carvings guaranteed to make you smile\, groan\, and laugh out 
 loud. This year’s theme celebrates the art of the pun\, with thousands o
 f hand-carved pumpkins bringing witty wordplay to life through pop culture
  references\, playful characters and pun-believable scenes. From clever on
 e-liners to delightfully cheesy dad jokes\, there’s something to make ev
 ery guest grin as they stroll The Great Pun-Kin Trail\, where over 5\,000 
 glowing jack-o’-lanterns illuminate the Zoo. Don’t miss New England’
 s “must-see” family-friendly event of the Halloween season at Roger Wi
 lliams Park Zoo. All tickets must be purchased online in advance. Tickets 
 are required and sold online only. No refunds or rescheduling. Buy Tickets
 \n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/jack-o-lantern-spectacu
 lar/92071/
LOCATION:Roger Williams Park Zoo\, 1000 Elmwood Avenue\, Providence\, RI 0
 2907
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/jack-o-lantern-spectacular/9207
 1/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Deja Vieux Vintage Shopping Bus Tour Adventure - October 4th
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
DTSTAMP:20260903T144336Z
UID:5fe8cdac575b282879f35adb305f@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:⭐Hop Aboard Rhode Island’s First - Ever Vintage Shops Bus 
 Tour!⭐ We invite you to join us at Deja Vieux Vintage for a uniquely cur
 ated shopping adventure! On Sunday\, October 4th\, from 10:30 AM to 4:00 P
 M\, we are hitting the road for a premier 5-hour vintage bus tour down Rou
 te 6 and Route 44. The tour features exclusive discounts at 8 to 12 of our
  favorite local antique and vintage shops\, making it the perfect day out 
 for collectors and vintage lovers alike. The Ultimate Vintage &amp\; Antiq
 ue Bus Tour Host: Deja Vieux Vintage Date &amp\; Time: Sunday\, October 4t
 h | 10:30 AM &#8211\; 4:00 PM Ticket Information: • Single Ticket: $37.5
 0 • Bring a Friend Bundle: Two for $70 Every ticket comes packed with va
 lue! You get your bus boarding pass\, event shopping bag\, coupon booklet
 \, complimentary snacks and water\, plus a chance to win prizes. Departure
  &amp\; Logistics Details: To ensure a smooth departure\, please arrive at
  Deja Vieux Vintage on Sunday\, October 4th\, before 10:30 AM. Our storefr
 ont will be open early so you can enjoy your very first shopping experienc
 e of the day! Parking is completely free. Our bus leaves promptly at 11:00
  AM. We will be traveling on a chartered yellow school bus from Ocean Stat
 e Transit\; please note that this vehicle is unfortunately not handicap ac
 cessible. Single ticket holders may need to share seats\, while our friend
 s bundles ticket holders guarantee seating together. Complimentary snacks 
 and water will be provided on board\, and you are welcome to bring your ow
 n allergen-free lunch. Tickets are non-refundable but are transferable.\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/deja-vieux-vintage-shoppi
 ng-bus-tour-adventure-october-4th/111403/
LOCATION:Deja Vieux Vintage\, 20 Cedar Swamp Rd.\, Smithfield\, 02917
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/deja-vieux-vintage-shopping-bus
 -tour-adventure-october-4th/111403/
END:VEVENT
